<p class="guide-kicker">Product Updates · Updated October 2026</p>
<h1>Changelog &amp; Release Notes</h1>
<p class="guide-intro">We continuously improve OnlinePDFPro to deliver fast, reliable, privacy-conscious PDF workflows without artificial paywalls or deceptive metrics.</p>

<div class="guide-body">
  <h2>October 2026 — Phase 1 &amp; Phase 2 Enhancements</h2>

  <h3>1. Flagship Workflows &amp; Direct Tool Access</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Prioritized the top 5 core workflows directly below the homepage hero: <strong>Merge PDF</strong>, <strong>Compress PDF</strong>, <strong>Split PDF</strong>, <strong>PDF Editor</strong>, and <strong>JPG to PDF</strong>.</li>
    <li>Added recommended next-step actions on completion screens (e.g., Merge &rarr; Compress, Split &rarr; Compress, Word &rarr; Word to PDF).</li>
    <li>Cleaned directory and category descriptions to eliminate conflicting marketing claims.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Transparent Privacy Architecture</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Introduced the 3-Tier Processing Boundary card distinguishing local client-side memory processing, ephemeral isolated server gateways, and opt-in cloud AI.</li>
    <li>Clarified visual electronic annotations versus cryptographic PKI signatures in Sign PDF.</li>
    <li>Clarified client-side Tesseract.js OCR vs explicit opt-in cloud OCR in Image to Text.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Official Downloadable Practice Pack &amp; Workflow Guides</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Published the non-sensitive <a href="/assets/examples/onlinepdfpro-practice-pack.zip" download="onlinepdfpro-practice-pack.zip">Official Practice Pack (ZIP)</a> featuring assignment and exam hall ticket fixtures.</li>
    <li>Published step-by-step illustrated guides: <a href="/guides/split-admit-card-pages/">Split an admit card or exam hall ticket</a> and <a href="/guides/compress-a-university-upload/">Compress a university or employment portal upload</a>.</li>
    <li>Linked test fixtures directly below upload dropzones across all top 10 core search landing pages.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4. Performance &amp; Mobile Responsive Reflow</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Reflowed homepage and tool layouts to pass 320px ultra-compact mobile viewport audits without horizontal overflow.</li>
    <li>Eliminated empty reserved advertisement spaces to guarantee zero content obstruction above the fold.</li>
    <li>Maintained strict static site performance budgets under 30 MB.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>5. Privacy-Safe Feedback</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Support and issue reporting now explicitly encourages qualitative error codes and non-sensitive test fixtures, ensuring zero user document bytes or filenames are transmitted in bug reports.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<aside class="guide-note">
  <h2>Have feedback or found a bug?</h2>
